<BaseLayout title="About — bllog"><section class="shell page-intro narrow"><p class="section-kicker">About</p><h1>A small place for clear thinking.</h1><p>bllog is an intentionally simple editorial template: strong typography, quiet surfaces, grayscale imagery and enough space around the content to let it breathe.</p></section><section class="shell about-grid"><div class="about-card"><h2>Editorial first</h2><p>Posts live as Markdown and become static pages at build time.</p></div><div class="about-card"><h2>Monochrome system</h2><p>Black, white and neutral greys only. Glass is reserved for navigation and transient controls.</p></div><div class="about-card"><h2>Centered composition</h2><p>Navigation uses a true three-column grid; article copy uses a fixed reading measure and balanced side rail.</p></div><div class="about-card"><h2>GitHub Pages ready</h2><p>Every push to main builds and deploys the site automatically.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>